    {
      "text": "every man shall be … a steward over his own property, D&C 42:32. priests and teachers shall have their stewardships, D&C 42:70. wise steward shall enter into the joy of his Lord, D&C 51:19. if they are not faithful in their stewardships, D&C 64:40. servants … send forth the accounts of their stewardships, D&C 69:5. account of this stewardship will I require, D&C 70:4 (72:3; 124:14). what the Lord requires of every man in his stewardship, D&C 70:9. faithful and wise steward shall inherit all things, D&C 78:22. judgment shall immediately follow, in your several stewardships, D&C 82:11. cut off those wicked, unfaithful, and unjust stewards, D&C 101:90. organize yourselves and appoint every man his stewardship, D&C 104:11. be diligent … that thou mayest be a wise steward, D&C 136:27.",
